<title>FRANCE: EU approves French food aid for Albania.</title>
<headline>EU approves French food aid for Albania.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has approved a shipment of French food aid to Albania, EU officials said late on Thursday.</p>
<p>The 730 tonnes of French flour will be shipped to the Balkan country in September under a project organised by the United Nations' World Food Programme.</p>
<p>The EU approved the transfer at a closed meeting of its 15-nation cereals management committee in Brussels on Thursday. The panel meets regularly to agree on grain export subsidies, though flour exports are currently taxed to prevent a run on domestic supplies.</p>
<p>((- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146))</p>
</text>
